          "text": "This term male neonate (born 39+2 weeks by SVD) was admitted to the Neonatal Unit at 6 hours of age with grunting, temperature 38.1°C and tachypnoea (RR 70), with a working diagnosis of neonatal sepsis in the context of maternal GBS positivity and intrapartum antibiotics given less than 4 hours before delivery.",
